WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.782
Livescore is public: anyone can follow the match, no PIN.

2
00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:11.218
"Connect tablets" → "Livescore": Scan with any phone or screen. No PIN needed.

3
00:00:11.268 --> 00:00:18.268
The livescore page (right) lists the live games with their score.

4
00:00:20.028 --> 00:00:23.230
Tap a game: the big scoreboard, for a screen or projector in the hall.

5
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:30.280
It updates at every rally.
